      "type" : "literal" ,
      "value" : "teacher/student lineage dpal mgon bran du gtad pa bram ze nag po 'i man ngag gi rjes gnang, Pha bong gsan yig, v. 1, pp..157\nGsung 'bum in 4 volumes.\nBuilt the Dbu-rtse Rnying-pa Gtsug-lag-khang.\nCalligraphed a golden Bka'-'gyur." ,
